# Copy this file to .env (which is gitignored) before `docker compose up -d`.
# GEMINI_API_KEY is consumed by the backend (T2.4) for chat, embedding, and
# multimodal PDF extraction. Obtain at https://aistudio.google.com/apikey.
#
# Note on data policy: free-tier Gemini API requests MAY be used to improve
# Google's models. For production / regulated use, enable billing on the
# Google Cloud project so the same API key falls under the paid-tier policy
# (no training on prompts/responses). See:
#   https://ai.google.dev/gemini-api/terms

GEMINI_API_KEY=
